### Get my squad (protected — native API Gateway key, see docs/adrs/002-native-api-gateway-key-for-squad-endpoint.md)
GET {{baseUrl}}/squad
x-api-key: {{mobileApiKey}}
Accept: application/json

### Get a player's price history — full trailing window + current-season start marker (protected — same native API Gateway key)
GET {{baseUrl}}/players/15396/price-history
x-api-key: {{mobileApiKey}}
Accept: application/json

### Get a player's current-season per-gameweek points (protected — same native API Gateway key)
GET {{baseUrl}}/players/15396/performance-history
x-api-key: {{mobileApiKey}}
Accept: application/json

### Get a player's previous-season per-gameweek points (protected — same native API Gateway key)
GET {{baseUrl}}/players/15396/performance-history?season=previous
